{"id":"0c86947761722640","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-lowforschnorrtest.md","title":"Schnorr 测试低性","display":"df-lowforschnorrtest — Schnorr 测试低性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-lowforschnorrtest","aliases":["43-df-lowforschnorrtest"],"display":"df-lowforschnorrtest — Schnorr 测试低性","depends_on":["[[43-df-schnorrtest]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28","source_locator":"§16.1.1, printed pp.480–484 / PDF pp.500–504","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"source_statement_checked":true},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-lowforschnorrtest"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-lowforschnorrtest</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-lowforschnorrtest — Schnorr 测试低性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§16.1.1, printed pp.480–484 / PDF pp.500–504"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U,V\">\\(U,V\\)</span> 为Cantor开集序列；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A\">\\(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b039951a7138aeff\" href=\"?note=b039951a7138aeff\" title=\"43-df-schnorrtest\">43-df-schnorrtest</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForSchnorrTest}(A)\\iff\\forall U\\,[\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\,(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}(V)\\land\\bigcap_nU_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_nV_n)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForSchnorrTest}(A)\\iff\\forall U\\,[\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\,(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}(V)\\land\\bigcap_nU_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_nV_n)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>独立于ML测试低性；Schnorr测试测度的相对可计算性需一并相对化。没有通用Schnorr测试，所以两种低性的等价不能直接照搬ML证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-schnorrtest","status":"resolved","id":"b039951a7138aeff","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-schnorrtest]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-schnorrtest","status":"resolved","id":"b039951a7138aeff","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；$U,V$ 为Cantor开集序列；$\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}$、$\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A$ 见 [[43-df-schnorrtest]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"U,V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LowForSchnorrTest}(A)\\iff\\forall U\\,[\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}^A(U)\\Rightarrow\\exists V\\,(\\mathrm{SchnorrTest}(V)\\land\\bigcap_nU_n\\subseteq\\bigcap_nV_n)].","display":true}],"bytes":1123,"backlinks":[{"id":"f5b5175508d7a1c1","anchor":"ref-352","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[43-df-lowforschnorrtest]] — Schnorr 测试低性"},{"id":"9a8a7256c17fd87a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-lowforschnorrtest]]、[[43-df-computably-traceable]]。"},{"id":"11d044ca7f8f7dac","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$A\\subseteq\\mathbb N$；见 [[43-df-lowforschnorr]]、[[43-df-lowforschnorrtest]]、[[43-thm-lowforschnorr-char]]、[[43-thm-schnorr-low-tests]]。"}],"outgoing":["b039951a7138aeff"]}